{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 13, :comments ["<b>And the Egyptians will hear.</b> And they will hear that which — You will slay them." "<b>For You brought up.</b> For כִּי serves in the sense of אֲשֶׁר — and they saw that which — You brought them up from among them with Your great power, and when they hear that You are slaying them, they will not say that they sinned against You, but they will say that against them You were able to wage battle, but against the inhabitants of the land You were not able to wage battle. And this is:"], :book :numbers, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 14, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:10:49.505049304Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}